    "d7.k.legacy": "Legacy jobs",
    "d7.hk.legacy": "Old exports that nobody rewrites overnight run in parallel with the new pipeline. An honest detail of any rollout: migration takes years.",
    "d7.k.tests": "Quality tests",
    "d7.hk.tests": "Source freshness, key uniqueness, mass balance reconciliation. A failed critical test blocks mart publication: yesterday’s figure beats a fresh wrong one.",
